{"case":"install-and-profile","manifest":"MV3 then MV2","result":"Observed","details":"Safari loaded MV3 into the default profile. Clearing the mixed global switch briefly enabled all profiles. Safari showed zero site grants at that point. After global disable and manual lab activation, Safari listed only the lab profile. All fixture grants followed that verification. Reloading the same temporary slot with the byte-identical MV2 staging directory contents retained lab-only activation and saved revision 2. This was a manifest comparison with shared storage, not two clean installs."}
